Scope of this licence

This licence covers only the files in this skill: SKILL.md, README.md,
scripts/, guides/gov/ and references/. It does not cover MYDS documentation,
code or assets (GovTech Malaysia / Jabatan Digital Negara), or SPLaSK
material (Jabatan Digital Negara). The skill does not include copies of
those; it links to them or reads them from the official websites at run time,
and their own terms apply. Short official phrases (such as the masthead
wording) are quoted so that implementations use the exact official text.

This project is unofficial and is not endorsed by any Malaysian government
agency. "MYDS", "SPLaSK", "JDN" and "GovTech Malaysia" are used only to
identify the official sources.
